<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">2 P'et'ros</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 P'et'ros</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 P'et'ros Woshts Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 P'et'.</para>
  <para style="mt">Wosheetso P'et'ros Gitl Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshetso P'et'ros woshts gitlts wosho b́ guut'e k'osh k'osh beyoke fa'a yoots krstiyaniwotsshe. B́ woshotse een keewo kootets daniyirwots gond finonat bodaniyo s'ilitsatse tuut gond ash woti beyo k'efosha. Tuuts kic'wotssh biitso wotitwo Iyesusi bo ááwon bek'tswotsnat b́daniferewre bo waazon shishts ashuwots bobeshits danatse tuutson Ik'onat doonzo Iyesus Krstosko ari dano daatse. Guut'tso bítsnor b́ kitsirwo «Krstos aanar waratse» etiru kooti danoshe, han s'ilitsatse keeweyor «Krstos aanar waaraniyere b́teshiye, Ik'o ash jamo b́morratse bíaanisha bako konwor asho b́ t'afitwk'o b́geerawotsne» etfe.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyani s'eegeyo 1:3-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Kootets danirwots 2:1-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos gitlo aanar b́ woo 3:1-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Iyesus Krstossh guutsonat woshef wottso Sim'on P'et'rosoke, Noko Izar Izewernat no ato Iyesus Krstosoke fa'a kááw imnetiyok'o mangts imnetiyo daatstswots itsh, <verse eid="2PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Ik'onat nodoonz Iyesusi danon s'aatonat jeenon itsh ayowe.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i s'aatonat s'eegetsmanats kup'etwok'o b́ íztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>B́mangonat b́dowon noon s'eegtso bín nodantsatse tuutson b́ Ik'i angon kashonat Ik'o aroosh geyitu jamo noosh imre. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>B́ mangonat b́ dowonn mangts k'awntso detstsonat ayidek't een wotts no jangiru aap'wotsi daatsdek'rone, janigiyets aap'anotsatse tuutson gond tewnatse datsanatse fa'a t'afotse k'ay keer Ik'i doyo kaydek'irwotsi it wotishee. <verse eid="2PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Manatse tuutson keewanots itsh bodabeetwok'o kup'ore, imnetiyatse doo woto, doo wotaatse dano, <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>danatse b́took keewdek'o, b́ took kordek'atse k'amoon kup'dek'o, k'amoon kup'dek'ats Ik' aro, <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>sheeng beeyats eshu eshwi shunewo, eshu eshuwi shuneeyatse shuno dabwere. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Keewanots ayaarr itsh bobere itdetsal nodoonz Iyesus Krstosi danosh woteraw shuu deshawwotsi itwoterawok'o iti kotetúne. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Keewanotsi deshawonmó wokts keewo bek'ofalaw aaw dooge, beshts b́morratsnowere b́s'ayintsok'o batk'rere.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Eshe ti eshwotso! its'eegeyonat itmarat'etsok'o arikon b́woto kitsosh baltsoniyere iki bogo kup'ore, man itk'aliyal b́ jamon gandeyar dihratste. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Mank'oon dúre dúrik wotts nodoonznat no aton Iyesus Krstos mengstots kindo s'eenon itsh imetwe.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Keewanotsi danfte wotiyalor, it detsts arikeewon itkúp'yalor hanots jango úni aawo itsh gawiyo fal k'ayaatse. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Dunkaniyok'o wotts tiatsanitse t befetsosh úni aawo itsh gawiyo kááw araatniye taash b́be'eyiri. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>No doonz Iyesus Krstos taash b́ kiitstsok'on datsanatse káári k'iron tk'aletwok'o danfee. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>And taa t kup'ir kááron itatse tk'aleyakon dab keewanotsi úni aawo gawdek'o it falitwok'owe.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos mangi jangosh ááwon bek'tswots bo gawts gawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Nodoonz Iyesus Krstos kúp'onat gitlo aanar b́weyi jango itsh nokeewor, notookon, eeno b́woto no ááwon bek'aat gawirwotsi bako ash weri gondon k'aniyets tururi jafro shoydek'atniyaaliye. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>«Tmaac' k'eeztso tshunts na'o haniye» etiru k'ááro mangts Ik'oke bísh b́woor, Ik'o nihoke mangonat een woton dek're. <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17-18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Mat. 17:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-7">Mar. 9:2-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-35">Luk'. 9:28-35</ref> </char></note> S'ayin guro abaatse bínton noteshor darotse waats k'ááran no notokon shishrone.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Jaman nebiyiwots bo keewtso arik b́ wottsok'oniye noosh bogshdek't bo kitsiri, mansh t'alwi beyoke fa'a c'eshosh sheengshde'er it kotfok'o nebiyiwots keewtsono sheengshde'er koto itn geyiyitwe, manowere it k'alit maargoyo b́ gatsfetsosh, datsgatsi mozofu it nibots b́ be'efetsoniye. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Jamoniyere shino t'iwintso itsh geytwo S'ayin mas'aafotse fa'o kon naari bek'on keewetso konwor b tookon b́ gawirwok'o bitsosh b́ falawok'oniye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft">Asho konwor b́ tookosh b́ gawirwok'on bitsosh falatse etirw k'osh bits bitson Nebiyo konworub́ tookon keewratse etiru biitso imosh falfe. </char></note> <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Kon naari bek'o b́jamon ash shunon waratse, ernmó bek'o shayiron jisheyiru ashuwots Ik'oke dek'tinye bokeewi.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kootets Danirwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Yoots dúron ash ashuwots dagotse kootets nebíyiwots bo teshtsok'o, it dagotsno shinomaants kootets danirwots beetúne, boowere t'af dowet kooti dano ááshon jamok b́ bad'itwok'owe bo woshiri, boon aaniy kewdek'ts doonzo danatse err káárts t'afo botokats bodoweti. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Mank'oon aywots boko wic'its weeri jafrats sha'itunee, bok'alts k'alatse tuutson ariweerindo b́ c'asheeti, <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Kootets daniyirwanots gizosh bo k'awntirwatse tuutson botookon bo tarikiyo keewfetsr iti meetune. Aydúroniyere shintson angsho boosh k'anwtsere, arikon t'afonwere bonee b́ kotiri!<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Melakiwotswor dab morro bofinor Ik'o boosh maac'o b́k'ewerawon t'alu dashan ayiwokts gop'otse tipeyarr angshosh koteyarr boteshtwok'o gahanemits boon juwb́k'ri, <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Aze. 6:1—7:24</ref> </char></note> Mank'o kááw naab́fo Nohi k'osh shawat ashuwotsnton kashit, Ik' Ik'iraw ashuwotsi boteshts datswatse t'afit atso b́ dowiyor maac'o k'ewat manoori datsjamo maarratse, <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aze. 19:24</ref> </char></note> Dabnworu Ik' Ik'iraw jamwots bí angsho boats b́ ariyetwok'o Sedomnat Gomor kitwots tulo bowotefetsosh mic'r bot'afitwok'o boats bí angshi, <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-6">Aze. 19:1-6</ref> </char></note> K'uurwots bofiniru wic'its finatse tuutson kic'efetst teshtso kááwo Lot'nomó b́ kashiyi, <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Kááw ash manwere bo dagotse b́ beyor aaw aawon b́ bek'tsonat b́ shishts nemal keewon b́ kashu b kic'efere b́ teshi. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Eshe jaman hank'o b́ wotiyakon doonzo bín ik'iyon beyiru ashuwotssh fadeyotse b́ oritwok'o, morretswotsno awúk'o b́ seziitwok'onat angshi aawosh aawk'o korde'er b́ ja'ituwok'o danfee etee. <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>Bítsnor kim wotts bo meets shunok'o sha'irwotsnat Ik' alo gac'irwotsi angshosh korde'er b́ k'aniti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Kootets danirwanots ááw shúk'etsonat bog noona etirwotsi bo wottsotse darotse alirwotsi bo c'ashor sharaatsne. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Melakiwots boyere kúp'wotsnat angetswotsn bowotiyaloru dab doonzo shinatse boon c'ayr nooni beshoon s'eents s'aamiyo shinomaants boats t'intsratsne. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Kootets danirwanotsmó t'iwnintsosh bofalaaw keewoniye bo c'ashiri, bo kambon detsewoonat úd'ewosh shuwetswotsk'o, azeyon boosh b́ shiyetsok'onat t'iwitsndek' falaaw gizwotskok'one, gizwots bo t'afitwok'o boowere b́ jamone t'afitune. <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Weeralo bo fintsotse bo k'awntso dek'etúne, boosh bo gene'o aaw sháánatse máshar weeralo gáálir, weralo gálonowere itnton bomor dáshitk wotts meets finon wic'itsonat jiitsitwotsi wotitune. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Morro finatse bo atso korde'aw gusiyi ááwo detsfne, bodetsts mor fini shunotse awror shashwo keyatsne, bo amantsatse kup'ar ned'eraw ashuwotsiye boant'elciri, gizoshe bok'awntiri. C'ashek ashne. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Bo kááw weero k'azk'rat t'afwtserne, gondo finar daatset gizo shuntso Bi'or naay Bel'am weerindo shoydek't sheelk'rernee. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15-16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Taaw. 22:4-35</ref> </char></note> Bel'amiyere b́ morratse tuutson fayere, noonkeewo falraw daazu ash noon keew keewon keewat bek'etso geyi fino k'eferaniye.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Ashaanots aats deshaw aats t'úp'ok'one, egurahon jokeyiru dawnotsk'one, nic' etts t'aluwo bonee b́ kotiri. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Darotse beyiru ashuwots dagotse k'az fart boweyiyako ayo ja'arafa'a ashuwotsi k'awnts deshaw míshí aap'o keewon meets tewnonat gusiyon dáshde aani morro maants bojishti. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>«S'ayino keshetute» err itsh bo jangiyiti. Asho b́ da'eyor bín da'atsosh guutso wotaarr b́ kéwetwotse bo botookon morrosh guutsne. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>No doonzonat noon kashitso Iyesus Krstosi danon datsatsi kiimotse k'az bo keshiyakon aanar kim mann detseyar bo da'eyal shintsoniye bogo iltso ayideniye gondo boosh b́ wotiti, <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>kááw weerindo bodaniyakon boosh imets S'ayin tzaziyo shuutso maants bo anoniyere kááwi weerindo dananiyere bo ooro k'anefe b́ teshi boosha. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Ari. 26:11</ref> </char></note> «B́ c'ooshtso móósh kano b́ c'oosho maants aani aanefe.» Mank'owere «Gúritso b́ mashiyakon aanar tok'ots b́ p'úp'refoni» etiru arik wotts jewro boats bodre.<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Doonzo Iyesus B́weetwok'o Jangiyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>T mashotso! itsh t guut'irwan gitl woshoniye, git woshúwotsi itsh t guut' keewanotsi gawde'er kááw asaabiyo it detsetwok'o itn kup'shosh etaatniye. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Hniyere shin S'ayin nebiywots bo keewts keewonat it wosheetsots weeron it datstso no doonz wottsonat noon woriits tzaziyo gaw itdek'etwok'o geefe. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:18">Yhu. 18</ref> </char></note> Jamoniyere shino han t'iwintsde'ere, s'uwaatsi aawwotsitse aatsnifetsr bo gond tewni jafrats sha'it k'aldirwots weetune, <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>Bowere «Doonzo Iyesus weetwe ett jangiyere eterosha b́ teshi? Beree, abee? Yoots nihwots bo k'irts dúron b́ tuutso jam keewo azeetso b́ teshtsok'one b́ beyiri» bo eteti. <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Aze. 7:11</ref> </char></note> Ashaanots ay dúroniyere shino daro Ik' aap'on bí azetsok'o datsunwere bdooze aatsonat aatsatse b́ wottsok'o danfetst danatsone bo eteti. <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Aze. 7:11</ref> </char></note> Manoori teshts datsunwere aatson k'oot'eyatniye b́ t'afi. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>And beyiru daronat datsonmó Ik' ash woterawwots bo t'afit angshi aawotsi tawosh koteyarniye bo tesheti.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:4">Dub. 90:4</ref> </char>
    </note> T mashotso! itmó doonzokere ik aawo kum aawok'o, kum aawo ik aawok'o b́ wottsok'o ik keewan batk'ayere. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Ik ik ashuwots boosh bí artsok'o doonzo keewt b́ jangits keewo s'eenosh ja'aratse, ernmó jam asho naandrone etosh b́ bodetwok'onat asho konwor b́ t'afawok'o b́ geetsotsne itsh b́ k'amiri.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk'. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">1 Tes. 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Bek'. 16:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Doonzo aawonmó danerawon úmp'etsok'o weetwe, manots aawots darwots k'áári eenon beshitúne, darotsi azeets jamo tawon mic'r t'afitwe. Datsunat biyatse finets keew jamo mis'etwe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft">K'osh bitson datsonat bitsere fa'a jamo sháánats keshetwe eto faletwe. </char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Eshe jam keewanots hank'on bot'afitkawotiyal, bere, it S'ayin beyon Ik'o arefetsr beyo aawk'oneya itsh geyiyo b́ k'azeti? <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>Eshe Ik' weet aawo mirac'on kotirwotsnat káári b́ weetwok'o k'alirwotsi wotoore, manoor daro tawon mic'r t'afitwe, azeetswots taw k'ees'on woc'wtsitúne, <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa. 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Bek'. 21:1</ref> </char></note> Ernmó noosh b́ jangitsok'on kááwo b́ beetwoko handr daronat handr datsatsne no kotiri.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Mansh t mashotso! jaman b́ wotit aawo kotoka itfa'oni wotiyala, doonzo ik jago it atse gond keewo wee k'efetwo deshawwotsi wotar jeenon iti b́ daatsitwok'o kúp'ar beewere,, <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>No doonz b́ k'amts k'amo itsh kasho b́ wottsok'o dande'ere, shunetso no eshu P'awlos bísh imets daniteelfok'on itsh b́ guut'tso haniye. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Bí han jangosh b́ wosh jamwotsitsere hank'on guut't, b́ woshwotsitsnoru ik ik keewwots t'iwintsosh falerawwots fa'ane. Dano boosh shaptswotsnat hake baka etiru k'oshwots S'ayin mas'afwotsi bo k'uurirwok'o keewanotsno bo k'uuriri, manowere bo k'alit bo t'afoshe.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Itmó t mashotso! haniyere shin shino dan itdek'tsotse weeri gondetswots dáróón geetseyar, it need'ts kúp' manatse it dihirawok'o it atso korde'ere, <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>dab maniyere no doonznat no ato Krstos Iyesus s'aatonat bín danon dambaan dambaan erere, bísh ando dúre dúroshowere mango wotowe! Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
